1466
01:50:04.833 --> 01:50:09.458
<i>I've never seen a batsman with this level</i>
<i>of confidence in his technique.</i>

1467
01:50:09.541 --> 01:50:11.750
<i>A fantastic innings of 110 runs.</i>

1468
01:50:11.833 --> 01:50:15.083
<i>Arjun's innings will be etched</i>
<i>in the history of Paddal stadium.</i>

