{\an8}<i>I hope it's blessings all the way</i>

1530
01:54:15.208 --> 01:54:16.541
{\an8}Yeah, Sanjay. Any updates?

1531
01:54:16.625 --> 01:54:18.416
{\an8}Karnataka is unstoppable this time.

1532
