Papa.

1692
02:06:11.000 --> 02:06:13.791
The paintbrushes are kept in the cupboard.

1693
02:06:13.875 --> 02:06:17.041
I can't reach it.
Could you please get them for me?

1694
02:06:19.166 --> 02:06:20.250
